ysical softness</h2>The characters have physical softness effect, using excellent physical softness system, greatly restore the real softness effect<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reminder function</h2>Different times of the day to remind players of things in their lives, such as eating and sleeping, or to customize reminders and enter text<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2>A Cute 3D Girl<br>Supports Key Detection<br>Custom poses<br>Custom colors<br>Physical softness effect<br>Reminder function",
